================================================================

若你违反本许可证任何条款，尤其是第 2 条的限制，本许可证授予你的权利将自动终止。终止后，你不得继续使用、复制或分发本软件（已合法持有的副本应删除或停止分发）。第 2 条的限制（含署名、GUI、代码逻辑、名称标识）在终止后继续有效，因其保护的是原作者的权利，而非单纯的许可条件。
If you breach any term of this License, especially the restrictions in Section 2, the rights granted to you terminate automatically. Upon termination you must cease using, copying, or distributing the Software (and delete or stop distributing any copies lawfully held). The restrictions in Section 2 (attribution, GUI, code logic, name and mark) survive termination, as they protect the original author's rights rather than merely being license conditions.

