LEGAL.md is a legal and compliance risk notice, not legal advice, and does not constitute a basis for exemption. The restrictions in this License take precedence over any broad reading of "study / modify"; in case of ambiguity, the restrictions govern. Consult a qualified lawyer for compliance, privacy, or platform-rule questions.

